cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Dam Breach Studio"
abstract: >-
  Process-based model of earthen and moraine dam breaching, from the trigger (overtopping, piping, or
  an impulse wave from a mass movement into the lake) to the outflow hydrograph. Includes a 1-D lumped
  morphodynamic breach model and a 2-D research engine.
authors:
  - given-names: "Aakash"
    family-names: "Mandal"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aakashmandal450-pixel/Dam-Breach-Studio"
type: software
keywords:
  - dam breach
  - GLOF
  - morphodynamics
  - sediment transport
